            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A woman presented with symptoms of vaginal bleeding and pelvic pain shortly after hysteroscopic sterilization. Sonographic and hysteroscopic images of a dislodged Essure microinsert (Conceptus Inc., San Carlos, CA) are provided.</AbstractText>
